#: ../../tools/eurostat_tools.rst:32 32f5d6b6667e4b7b93cf006108f06574
msgid ""
"**Description**: Retrieve statistical data from Eurostat (EU statistical "
"office) for a specific dataset and filter combination. Eurostat provides "
"10,000+ datasets covering EU member states for economics (GDP, inflation,"
" trade), social statistics (population, employment, poverty), health, "
"environment, agriculture, and more. Returns time-series values with "
"dimension metadata. Common datasets: 'demo\\_pjan' (population by "
"age/sex), 'nama\\_10\\_gdp' (GDP), 'ilc\\_li01' (poverty rate), "
"'env\\_air\\_gge' (GHG emissions), 'hlth\\_ehis\\_fv3e' (health). Use "
"Eurostat database explorer to find dataset codes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/eurostat_tools.rst:34 760aa04a03ec4bb4bc31aa22f477f156
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/eurostat_tools.rst:36 e6ffad93897345488ab0b30c72e085b8
msgid ""
"``datasetCode`` (string) (required) Eurostat dataset code. Examples: "
"'demo\\_pjan' (population by age/sex), 'nama\\_10\\_gdp' (GDP), "
"'ilc\\_li01' (at-risk-of-poverty rate), 'env\\_air\\_gge' (GHG "
"emissions), 'une\\_rt\\_a' (unemployment rate), 'tec00001' (GDP per "
"capita)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/eurostat_tools.rst:39 49abcf8eac0c44929f2d428098eab5f6
msgid ""
"``geo`` (string, null) (optional) Country/region code filter. EU country "
"codes: DE (Germany), FR (France), IT (Italy), ES (Spain), PL (Poland), NL"
" (Netherlands), BE (Belgium), SE (Sweden). Use 'EU27\\_2020' for EU "
"average."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/eurostat_tools.rst:42 b9b057f67d2b43009f3f197ab6a53b8b
#, python-format
msgid ""
"``unit`` (string, null) (optional) Unit of measurement filter (dataset-"
"specific). Examples: 'PC' (percentage), 'NR' (number), 'CP\\_MEUR' "
"(million EUR current prices), 'PC\\_GDP' (% of GDP), 'T' (tonnes)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/eurostat_tools.rst:45 308d1f6af6a24723b12f5e12b0f3fdfa
msgid ""
"``na_item`` (string, null) (optional) National accounts item filter for "
"economic datasets (e.g., 'B1GQ' for GDP, 'P3' for final consumption)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/eurostat_tools.rst:48 900a0972f0ed4465810ed079216ecf55
msgid ""
"``time`` (string, null) (optional) Time filter (year or time range). "
"Examples: '2022', '2015:2022' (range)"
msgstr ""

